# Steps 2.2 + 3.2 — registration (Flow 5) with idempotency keys. Run `bun run dev`;
# VS Code "REST Client" keeps cookies. Needs a hackathon (hackathons.http) and a user with a
# complete profile. Every register call needs an `Idempotency-Key` header (a new UUID per
# action: {{$guid}}); resending the SAME key replays the original response.
@base = http://localhost:3000
@origin = http://localhost:3000
@hackathon = hackfest-2026
# Change this before re-running the replay demo (keys are kept 24 h).
@key = demo-register-key-0001

### Sign in
POST {{base}}/api/auth/sign-in/email
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}

{ "email": "pat@example.com", "password": "REPLACE_ME" }

### My status before registering → registered: false (200, not 404)
GET {{base}}/api/hackathons/{{hackathon}}/me

### Register → 201 (body must be {}; JSON content type and Idempotency-Key required)
POST {{base}}/api/hackathons/{{hackathon}}/register
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}
Idempotency-Key: {{key}}

{}

### Same key again → the SAME 201 body + `Idempotent-Replayed: true` (nothing new written)
POST {{base}}/api/hackathons/{{hackathon}}/register
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}
Idempotency-Key: {{key}}

{}

### Same key, different request (another hackathon) → 422 IDEMPOTENCY_KEY_REUSED
POST {{base}}/api/hackathons/winter-build-26/register
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}
Idempotency-Key: {{key}}

{}

### New key → a new action → 409 ALREADY_REGISTERED
POST {{base}}/api/hackathons/{{hackathon}}/register
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{}

### No Idempotency-Key → 400
POST {{base}}/api/hackathons/{{hackathon}}/register
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}

{}

### My status after → registered: true, participantId, registeredAt
GET {{base}}/api/hackathons/{{hackathon}}/me

### Detail now counts participants
GET {{base}}/api/hackathons/{{hackathon}}

### Unknown hackathon → 404 HACKATHON_NOT_FOUND
POST {{base}}/api/hackathons/no-such-hackathon/register
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{}

### A user without a GitHub username or skills → 409 PROFILE_INCOMPLETE, details.missing
# (sign in as that user first). Failures are not stored: the same key re-runs next time.
